                                "sense_id": "266ff12a-f9ab-3da9-b690-da29770cf1b2",
                                "text": "\"The shame of refusing to meet you!—from the shame of meeting an equal I might,\" said Kingston, tauntingly; \"but it is absurd to be challenged by my hired servant—a low-born nobody!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbe128f8-f5b8-4d44-8c6f-cad2878f4307",
                                "sense_id": "266ff12a-f9ab-3da9-b690-da29770cf1b2",
                                "text": "This is the prettiest low-born lass that ever\nRan on the green-sward."
                            }
